// Fixture for the `oskel build` rejection of SDL3 in freestanding mode.
//
// SDL3 is a host binding: the freestanding image has no host and no linker, so
// the build must fail with the dedicated extern message and exit 65, never emit
// a binary. The import is the module's own, so this also covers the rule that
// an *unused* `extern "C"` is harmless while a used one fails cleanly.
import std.internal.sdl;

print(std.internal.sdl.initVideo());
